<title>PORTUGAL: M.Confianca stake held by BCP not for sale.</title>
<headline>M.Confianca stake held by BCP not for sale.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 20 percent stake in Portuguese insurer Mundial Confianca held by the Banco Comercial Portugues/Banco Portugues do Atlantico group is not for sale, BCP/BPA president Jorge Jardim Goncalves said.</p>
<p>&quot;BCP/BPA is not selling the 20 percent stake it has in Mundial Confianca,&quot; Jardim Goncalves told Reuters on the sidelines of a company presentation.</p>
<p>&quot;This stake in Mundial Confianca is to be kept,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>Some local news reports had said that BCP/BPA could be interested in selling its stake in Mundial Confianca.</p>
<p>-- Jose Barata, Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
